["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20.建筑师戚山山：人生不是“既要又要还要”，而是“我就要这个” safe play\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-tanpai-建筑师不与别人竞争-只跟一百个自己赛跑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/68d3da25c54fc635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"摊\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">摊牌｜创业观察</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>建筑师不与别人竞争，只跟一百个自己赛跑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她说自己从不觉得在卷，是因为压根没有要卷的对象——建筑师戚山山的生命力不是自律撑出来的，而是先问自己到底喜不喜欢，再决定做不做。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">建筑</span><span class=\"tag\">女性创业者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom vs. Safety: Axon CEO Rick Smith on the Future of Policing ALPR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-allin-axon-ceo-警用无人机未来该配非致命武器-而不是枪/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/561dcd474c610c53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Axon CEO:警用无人机未来该配非致命武器，而不是枪</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Axon 主张用无人机和机器人搭载非致命武器取代警察持枪对峙，开火权仍归人类，但要多人实时审批才能启动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">创业史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 344: Philosophy as Dialogue Seventh Letter aporetic dialogue divine madness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-verybad-柏拉图说真正的哲学教诲根本不能被写下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de9fabd2316045b0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>柏拉图说真正的哲学教诲根本不能被写下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柏拉图在《第七封信》里说自己从未写下真正的哲学教诲，因为哲学不完全是命题，而是一种经验；对话体之所以存在，正是为了承载写不下来的那部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柏拉图</span><span class=\"tag\">哲学方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Designing for Agents — Zeno Rocha, Resend MCP AEO/GEO Domain Connect SES llms.txt\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-latentspace-体量大100倍的对手-却被下载量反超-规模不是护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af0f478aa0a3653b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>体量大100倍的对手，却被下载量反超：规模不是护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">没有邮件背景的创始人靠产品体验把下载量反超，而发明DevRel的Twilio收购SendGrid后却把它晾在一边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">邮件基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">MCP</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Neuron Basis: Goodfire&#x27;s Curt Tigges on Agentic Interp, Monosemanticity &amp; Reverse Engineering gated MLP (SwiGLU) monosemanticity ablation SAE (sparse autoencoder) neuron scientist\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-cogrev-单个神经元的含义没有想象中混乱-智能体逐个审问找到答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd1b0999555e3944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:56:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>单个神经元的含义没有想象中混乱：智能体逐个审问找到答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">门控MLP让神经元只在少数几个含义间切换而非上百种混杂；AI智能体逐一做实验验证后，能用一段描述准确预测神经元的行为，推翻了「神经元太脏读不懂」的旧说法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解释性</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Washington keeps helping China catch up in AI | Luisa Rodriguez distillation wakesurfer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-eightythousand-中国ai没有自研超车-靠的是租美国算力-抄美国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad5a0c87762b8e27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">26:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>中国AI没有自研超车，靠的是租美国算力、抄美国模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国模型只落后美国约六个月，但这差距很大程度靠境外租用英伟达芯片和对美国模型的知识蒸馏撑起来——一旦美国堵住这两条路，真实差距会比看起来大得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片租赁</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"HubSpot’s Co-Founder on Finding Your Next Startup Idea Yellow Brick Road second brain context graph evals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-a16z-chatgpt和claude已是新操作系统-但护城河不在界面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>ChatGPT和Claude已是新操作系统，但护城河不在界面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">HubSpot联合创始人判断：模型正趋于可替换的基础设施，没有人能卡住创业者的供应链咽喉；真正的护城河是沉淀下来的工作与数据，而非用户进入的那个聊天框。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">平台生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nik Storonsky: The most uncompromising banking CEO K-factor NPAP (New Product Approval Process) OCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-cheekypint-revolut-ceo-把银行信贷类比卖期权-收十年租金-一年亏光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9d2ccbd206c41a7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Revolut CEO 把银行信贷类比卖期权：收十年租金，一年亏光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放贷利润会被经济周期一次性抹平，所以 Revolut 把放贷目标压到资产负债表不到10%、其余证券化出表，宁可做订阅制科技公司，也不做传统净息差银行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新型银行</span><span class=\"tag\">产品运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shadi Hamid and Matthew Kaemingk on Whether Democracy Needs Religion idolatry political hobbyism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-goodfight-政治变得越世俗-反而越像一场圣战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>政治变得越世俗，反而越像一场圣战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两位作者认为，当人们不再从宗教获得身份认同与终极意义，这种渴望并未消失，而是转移进了政治——这正是美国政治走向「圣战化」的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教与政治</span><span class=\"tag\">政党政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Elon Musk Solves Problems | Jon McNeill battlefield promotion bill of materials weighted ETF Follow Me Home exercise Fire Yourself exercise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-knowledge-马斯克的产品算法-自动化是最后一步-不是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/586a4f39f9c67632-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克的产品算法：自动化是最后一步，不是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉团队曾因为先自动化而在同一个问题上卡住数月：马斯克的算法要求先删需求、简化流程、手动跑通，自动化永远是最后一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span><span class=\"tag\">马斯克</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"515 从铁幕创作到解冻文艺：漫谈世界电影史中的波兰巨匠安杰伊·瓦伊达 Zespół filmowy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-cn2aa250-波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的-没进戛纳就等于没拍过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的：没进戛纳就等于没拍过</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者说大卫·波德威尔写罗马尼亚电影史时一个字都没提，不是因为片子差，而是因为那些片子从没被送到西方能看见的电影节。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">波兰电影</span><span class=\"tag\">冷战文化政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Perfectly Leveraged for the Squat progressive overload majestic womanhood manhood stones Title IX\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-ninepi-被遗忘的维多利亚大力女明星-当年体重大才被认为又强又美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">35:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>被遗忘的维多利亚大力女明星：当年体重大才被认为又强又美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现代人以瘦为美的观念只有一百多年历史——维多利亚时代的马戏团大力女星体重两百磅，却被封为「世界上最强壮也最美丽的女人」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性力量史</span><span class=\"tag\">举重</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How college football&#x27;s deadliest year built the NCAA flying wedge mass momentum play NIL death harvest\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-throughline-老罗斯福不是ncaa诞生的真正推手-一场校园死亡才是导火索/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>老罗斯福不是NCAA诞生的真正推手，一场校园死亡才是导火索</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1905年「死亡丰收年」后，真正催生NCAA新规则委员会的不是老罗斯福的三校会议，而是NYU校长绕开大三校另起炉灶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育史</span><span class=\"tag\">NCAA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 227 Carbon Monoxide: Haunted houses &amp; coal mine canaries carboxyhemoglobin hyperbaric oxygen\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-tpwky-历史上许多-闹鬼事件-其实是一氧化碳中毒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>历史上许多「闹鬼事件」,其实是一氧化碳中毒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一氧化碳不仅抢着跟血红蛋白结合，还让已经结合的氧气释放不出来——这种双重机制造成的症状太诡异，历史上常被诊断成闹鬼或精神病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">毒理学</span><span class=\"tag\">医学史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"297: Why Teens Lie—and How to Respond Without Escalating Haim Ginott smell test perspective game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-asklisa-心理学家-教孩子对同伴撒谎自保-好过逞强说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fae74bb25cb36023-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>心理学家：教孩子对同伴撒谎自保，好过逞强说真话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">面对同伴怂恿抽大麻之类的场合，她宁可教孩子说一句谎把责任推给父母脱身，也不要孩子因找不到体面拒绝方式而冒险——目标是安全优先，不是诚实至上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年教育</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Loud, Messy, Physical - What To Do When Kids Won&#x27;t Stop Fighting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-unruffled-孩子打架别急着拉开-冲突本身就是他们在学社交/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打架别急着拉开：冲突本身就是他们在学社交</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">频繁的尖叫、撕咬甚至打你一巴掌，往往不是孩子出了问题，而是父母越介入，冲突就越容易变成孩子们抢夺「妈妈注意力」的戏码。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子教育</span><span class=\"tag\">手足冲突</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When You Try What You&#x27;re Bad At | Challenge Accepted\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-goodinside-六枚冬奥奖牌得主说-我更擅长的是重新当一个新手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">48:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>六枚冬奥奖牌得主说：我更擅长的是重新当一个新手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的垒球梦在一次搞砸的试训后彻底终结，转去完全陌生的雪车项目，靠的不是天赋延续，而是一次次主动放弃「我很厉害」的身份重新归零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">成长心态</span><span class=\"tag\">身份认同</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E258｜聊聊硅谷创业“修道院”HF0与OpenRouter早期故事 spray and pray subtraction Demo Dinner unified interface for LLMs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-sv101-以为硅谷孵化器教的是增长黑客-学到的却是只做一件事的减法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">54:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>以为硅谷孵化器教的是增长黑客，学到的却是只做一件事的减法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创始人说最难的减法不是去掉不重要的娱乐，而是只盯住对公司最重要的那件事，甚至排除掉第二重要的事情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">HF0</span><span class=\"tag\">孵化器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"151 ✪ 从「需要」到「想要」：中国时尚品牌集体向上 lookbook intangible assets\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-fengtouquan-消费降级论被打脸-千元档国货时尚品牌增速是大盘六倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"疯\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">疯投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>消费降级论被打脸：千元档国货时尚品牌增速是大盘六倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天猫数据显示，客单价1500至2000元的轻奢价位国货品牌，今年成交增速是整个服装电商大盘的六倍，消费者正在为向往感而非性价比买单。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">时尚品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">电商经营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"512 – Oops, All Henrys exchequer investiture controversy homage mark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-britishhist-把6岁女儿嫁给未来皇帝-英格兰国库的第一笔开支是联姻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>把6岁女儿嫁给未来皇帝：英格兰国库的第一笔开支是联姻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利把6岁的女儿许配给靠软禁父亲上位的德意志国王，为此开出的一万马克聘金，与鲁弗斯当年卖掉整个诺曼底公国的价码完全相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">王室联姻</span><span class=\"tag\">封建效忠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen and His Spy Romeo Entity List\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-商务部明知英伟达合作方由中国间谍操控-仍放行48亿美元芯片/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/19b361072bd3e2fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>商务部明知英伟达合作方由中国间谍操控，仍放行48亿美元芯片</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商务部早已掌握Megaspeed由中国间谍运营的情报，仍选择不执行本可阻断其芯片供应的既有规定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Frontier Labs Buy: A Data Deep Dive with Handshake AI — Garrett Lord &amp; Team RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) reward hacking redlining Care Bench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-latentspace-银行家宁可从零重做-也不愿修改ai给出的95-正确答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1b6b68e7fa0afc2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>银行家宁可从零重做，也不愿修改AI给出的95%正确答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修复一个95%正确的AI输出，花的时间和从零开始一样多，因为错误藏在公式与判断的细节里，而非表层格式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据标注</span><span class=\"tag\">金融建模</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anne of Brittany proxy marriage book of hours Estates of Brittany\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-stuffmissed-安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国-死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国，死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安妮一生三次嫁人、两次加冕法国王后，用婚姻条款逼法国承认布列塔尼的独立地位，但她死后国王还是违背她的遗愿，把布列塔尼并入了法国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治联姻</span><span class=\"tag\">布列塔尼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scott Kupor on Building a16z and Rebuilding the Federal Workforce OPM GS-14 permissioned risk time-in-grade phalanx\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-a16z-美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">退休申请走完所有流程后，纸质件要被送进宾夕法尼亚一座废弃石灰岩矿洞人工归档——卡住它的不是技术，是没人愿意为改善系统去承担被国会问责的风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>"]